{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f192d38140bd83396e5db9f56806cbfb88ca67f6be5bc8ba29495d34c0a4a38d", "ja": "未来。ブログ、いい感じに書けてたぞ。\n新しい衣装も気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "未来，博客写得很不错啊。\n看来你也很喜欢新服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "22c9f626e047d99af2ac75a859aa5457786cf36b3cfbfb42c0027fdd8c269259", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　これすっごく、\nすーっごくカワイイです！　一目惚れしちゃいました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！这个真的，真～的特别可爱！我一见钟情了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "fea6e6b608c831b226bc5b90072698632a1c17db6a685d363251e2c7a68df277", "ja": "どうですか、似合ってますか！？\n私、こんな衣装がもらえて、すっごく嬉しいです♪", "zh": "怎么样，很适合我吧！？\n能拿到这么可爱的服装，我真的特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "139be8475c8d45670bd7b52f513a59c19b85bc3af1bc0c0b8281f558ec7ede50", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\n未来にピッタリだ。", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n和未来简直是绝配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "881a9c1fea9ddda61dbaeca85a4d999ec057fa82308992d6fbecd87f7cc664e7", "ja": "本当ですか！？\nでへへ、褒められちゃった♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n嘿嘿，被夸了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1039e2061a32d71b633e2e63f55abd0c86ff55e8fee5db0fc47b1912901d1e2c", "ja": "うん、サイズ感もピッタリだな。\n一分の隙もない。さすがは青羽さん、採寸も完ぺきだ。", "zh": "嗯，尺寸也正合适。\n简直无懈可击。不愧是青羽小姐，量尺寸也无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "1baf0edfa933b4d48ec15179d8075bd2dcbebb1137f39f82ac752215e68d18f9", "ja": "ピッタリ……はっ。{$P$}さん、\nホントにピッタリですか！？　ピッチリじゃなくて？？", "zh": "严丝合缝……啊。{$P$}先生，真的严丝合缝吗！？不是紧绷绷的吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "09eb46b1e4ad0364cdfeea18ad8a474a6688781bc9928b979a1acec46a36b859", "ja": "え？　ああ……それが、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "咦？啊……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "8700eafe7e9370f9c42f882c4f5fb7fea916f20e020c330d441285b9ec32b2ae", "ja": "実は昨日、翼にケーキバイキングに誘われて……。\nおとといは、美奈子ちゃんのお店にも……。", "zh": "其实昨天，翼约我去了蛋糕自助餐……\n前天还去了美奈子家的店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "24477cde3e4cf6556b21edc074d668e82f5748bd4dbe422926b7ae5d7e59631b", "ja": "な、なるほど。\n……もしかして、食べ過ぎたとか？", "zh": "原、原来如此。\n……难道说，你吃得太多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "037348f512024b00ab7b5e7c49bc3acb5fe4f75c07ab3c48142df9d13d6b5df7", "ja": "いえ！　今日試着だからケーキは小さいのにしたし、\n美奈子ちゃんの肉まんも2個でガマンしたんです！", "zh": "不是！因为今天要试穿，我特意选了小蛋糕，美奈子做的肉包也只吃了2个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "65cfc319c36a6b481c31e8052800d2a5bbe4c5212729e6a3e3d89b35cbc0923d", "ja": "うう……美味しそうだったなぁ。\n美奈子ちゃんの特製チャーシュー揚げまん……。", "zh": "呜呜……看起来好好吃啊。\n美奈子特制的叉烧炸包子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "523332ac6880fae309aee7e80e734612bcf3542988ecc73561655b89312bdfd1", "ja": "そ、そうか。そこそこ食べてるな……。\nでも、ちゃんとガマンできてるじゃないか。", "zh": "是、是吗。你吃得还不少嘛……不过，你不是也好好忍住了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "4d18c80f7fc3e8d0d69490abc8fe0318e0652da86b4b2365983caa2156b61fcf", "ja": "でも、もしかしたら……って思って。\nあの、大丈夫ですか？　おなかとか……おなかとか～！", "zh": "可是，我在想，会不会……那什么，你没事吧？肚子什么的……肚子什么的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b94e108febcf8ded233375d89d54d094530bf0ed7d3d45dfa49cdbfb70ead805", "ja": "ああ……そういうことか。\n今回はセパレートの衣装だもんな。", "zh": "啊……原来是这么回事。\n这次穿的是分体式服装嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "74add80b8c6a791acd1094a7011cbf5e3415949b4f9710c062d5ccd23bac4355", "ja": "でも、本当に大丈夫だよ。おなかもシュッとしてる！\n未来がしっかり自己管理をしたおかげだな。", "zh": "不过，真的没问题。肚子也很平坦！\n多亏未来好好地自我管理了一番。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "c0b7d9f53453a3349d331a2f437ae1e7ab699c618e4365483a2e55a25d69b4bc", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか！？　よかったぁ～！\nえへへ、ホッとしちゃいました♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？太好了～！\n嘿嘿，这下总算放心了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "a71bc45f82abbe4e2ad602588599585dcf9ebc6b7ce71f619adc8f2c6940b72f", "ja": "あ。でも、まだ気を抜いたらダメですよね！\nしばらく食べ過ぎには気をつけますっ。", "zh": "啊。不过，现在还不能放松警惕，对吧！\n接下来一段时间我会注意不吃得太多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c9c0efe07c6e7c26999793557f99198fa16b31828fa41f9e2ec828e0b60ab82b", "ja": "そうだな、油断は禁物だ。\nでも、食事を抜いたりはしないようにな？", "zh": "是啊，千万不能掉以轻心。不过，也别不吃饭，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "15fc8c6febc23ccfbf544d58e372548b7f8376a2d81ce84e914e68293272703e", "ja": "大丈夫です、ぜったい抜きません♪\n私、ちゃんと食べないと元気でないもん。", "zh": "没问题的，我绝对不会不吃♪\n我不吃饱的话，可是会打不起精神的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0204_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "d5752faaaa47995c7d1aaa2cf1635dc5343dc40d1cd1df4834e60b8408f6f928", "ja": "今朝もごはんおかわりしました！\nお昼ごはんも大盛りで～♪　……ん？", "zh": "今天早上我也添饭了！\n午饭也要大碗的～♪……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
